      <div n="1">
        <head>§. 1.</head>
        <p>
          <s corresp="comments_1731.xml#p1-1-s1">Right at the beginning it should be noted that where the
          <ref target="#note-0000001105515864 #note-0000000438118919">leap from c# 
          to a#</ref> occurs, a <ref target="#note-0000000845814796">b</ref>
          must be played in between the notes as an appoggiatura
          with a short trill.</s>
        </p>
      </div>

